{"timestamp":"2026-07-12T17:05:31.764Z","ordinal":265,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"019f570a-9eb7-70f3-97cd-cce65bf10c00","turn_id":"019f5748-e442-75d1-be37-2f5dba521539","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"item-37","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Oui. Les deux chemins sont sur le même volume APFS : `mv` sera donc quasi instantané et ne recopiera pas les 49 Go. Ferme Unreal et Epic Launcher complètement, puis colle ce script dans Terminal :\n\n```bash\nOLD='/Users/Shared/Epic Games/UE_5.8'\nNEW='/Users/zenray/Create/Build/UE_5.8'\nEPIC=\"$HOME/Library/Application Support/Epic\"\nMAN=\"$EPIC/EpicGamesLauncher/Data/Manifests\"\nBACKUP=\"$HOME/Desktop/Epic-UE58-backup-$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)\"\n\nosascript -e 'tell application \"Epic Games Launcher\" to quit' 2>/dev/null || true\nsleep 4\ntest -d \"$OLD\" || { echo \"Source introuvable\"; exit 1; }\ntest ! -e \"$NEW\" || { echo \"Destination déjà existante\"; exit 1; }\n\nmkdir -p \"$BACKUP\"\ncp \"$EPIC/UnrealEngineLauncher/LauncherInstalled.dat\" \"$BACKUP/\"\ncp \"$MAN\"/{9EA1EC35E342C85A14E8F39D14CEC577, B0426A81344517AD7464A595179E235C, FA9D2103934D7A5709A3519A8477E9C2}.item \"$BACKUP/\" 2>/dev/null\ncp \"$EPIC/UnrealEngine/Editor/ProjectEditorRecords.json\" \"$BACKUP/\" 2>/dev/null || true\n\nmv \"$OLD\" \"$NEW\"\n\npython3 - \"$EPIC/UnrealEngineLauncher/LauncherInstalled.dat\" \\\n  \"$MAN/9EA1EC35E342C85A14E8F39D14CEC577.item\" \\\n  \"$MAN/B0426A81344517AD7464A595179E235C.item\" \\\n  \"$MAN/FA9D2103934D7A5709A3519A8477E9C2.item\" \\\n  \"$EPIC/UnrealEngine/Editor/ProjectEditorRecords.json\" <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport sys\nold = \"/Users/Shared/Epic Games/UE_5.8\"\nnew = \"/Users/zenray/Create/Build/UE_5.8\"\nfor name in sys.argv[1:]:\n    p = Path(name)\n    if p.exists():\n        p.write_text(p.read_text().replace(old, new))\nPY\n\nopen -a \"Epic Games Launcher\"\necho \"Déplacement terminé. Backup : $BACKUP\"\n```\n\nLe script met aussi à jour les manifestes Epic ; ne clique surtout pas sur `Install` si le launcher affiche temporairement 5.8 comme absent. Vérifie simplement que le bouton devient `Launch` et que `ZenRayDesign` s’ouvre. Ne supprime le backup du Bureau qu’après cette vérification."}],"phase":"final_answer"},"completed_at_ms":1783875931764}}
